{
  "key": 18307,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_ThankGoodnessYoureHere",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, thank goodness that you happened\n",
        "to be there!\r",
        "If it weren’t for you, who knows how\n",
        "far away my BUNEARY could have run...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh, heureusement que tu étais là!\r",
        "Sans toi, qui sait où mon LAPOREILLE\n",
        "se serait enfui...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_BackIntoThePokeBall",
      "en_US": [
        "Baby BUNEARY, back into the Poké\n",
        "Ball you go!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Petit LAPOREILLE, tu vas tout de\n",
        "suite rentrer dans ta Poké Ball!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_ImKeira",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m Keira!\n",
        "I’m a Pokémon Contest Judge.\r",
        "Be sure to drop by the Contest Hall\n",
        "so I can thank you properly!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je m’appelle Karine!\n",
        "Je suis Juge de Concours Pokémon.\r",
        "Passe à la Salle de Concours, je te\n",
        "remercierai comme il se doit!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_ComeBackAnotherTime",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, there!\n",
        "How’s it going, Trainer?\r",
        "You being here tells me you’re going\n",
        "to challenge the Gym Leader.\r",
        "Well... I hate to break it to you, but\n",
        "that’s impossible.\r",
        "You’re questioning why, and the answer\n",
        "is: she’s not here.\r",
        "Not to worry, though.\n",
        "We know she’s at the Contest Hall.\r",
        "Come back another time, OK?\n",
        "I’ll be waiting right here."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Salut, toi!\n",
        "Comment ça va, Dresseur?\r",
        "Ta présence ici me dit que tu as\n",
        "l’intention de défier le Champion.\r",
        "Euh... sans vouloir jouer les rabat-joie\n",
        "ça ne va pas être possible.\r",
        "Tu te demandes pourquoi? C’est bien\n",
        "simple: elle n’est pas là.\r",
        "Mais ne t’inquiète pas.\n",
        "Elle est à la Salle de Concours.\r",
        "Reviens plus tard, d’accord?\n",
        "Je t’attendrai ici."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_LetsGetTheShowStarted",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Ta-daah!\n",
        "Kept me waiting again, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "Let’s see how much tougher you and\n",
        "I have gotten, right here and now!\r",
        "Hey, you’re a Trainer now. You’re\n",
        "expected to be ready for a battle.\r",
        "No whining! No waiting!\n",
        "Let’s get the show started!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Ta-daah! Tu m’as encore\n",
        "fait attendre, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "Voyons combien nous avons progressé,\n",
        "ici et maintenant!\r",
        "Hé, t’es un Dresseur maintenant, tu\n",
        "dois toujours être sur le qui-vive.\r",
        "On pleurniche pas! On s’enfuit pas!\n",
        "Le spectacle va bientôt commencer!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_WaaahILostAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Waaah!\n",
        "What are you saying? I lost again?!\r",
        "It goes to show my surefire winning\n",
        "strategy doesn’t work.\r",
        "Say, hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\n",
        "Remember what I told you before?\r",
        "Make sure all your attacks hit!\n",
        "Avoid every enemy attack!\r",
        "I thought that was a wicked strategy,\n",
        "but it doesn’t work worth beans.\r",
        "I guess I have to grind it out and\n",
        "toughen up the team a bit at a time.\r",
        "Anyway!\n",
        "Where to next?\r",
        "The closest place is Solaceon Town,\n",
        "I think?\r",
        "That’ll do! I’m off to Solaceon Town!\n",
        "See ya, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "You’ll be shocked by my growth the\n",
        "next time we meet!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Ouaaah! Qu’est-ce qui\n",
        "se passe? J’ai encore perdu?!\r",
        "Ça prouve que ma stratégie infaillible\n",
        "ne marche pas.\r",
        "Dis, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\n",
        "Tu te rappelles ce que je t’ai dit?\r",
        "Fais en sorte que toutes tes attaques\n",
        "atteignent leur cible et évite les\f",
        "attaques ennemies!\r",
        "J’étais sûr que je tenais la tactique\n",
        "parfaite mais elle ne vaut pas un clou!\r",
        "Je vais devoir ravaler ma fierté et\n",
        "entraîner encore mon équipe.\r",
        "Bref, passons!\n",
        "Et maintenant?\r",
        "La ville la plus proche, c’est Bonville,\n",
        "je crois?\r",
        "Parfait! En route pour Bonville!\n",
        "A la revoyure, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "Tu verras, la prochaine fois, je serai\n",
        "si fort que t’en reviendras pas!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_FoundAnEggAtDayCare",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you know?\r",
        "They found an Egg at the Day Care in\n",
        "Solaceon Town past here."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu as appris la nouvelle?\r",
        "Ils ont trouvé un Oeuf à la Pension\n",
        "de Bonville."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_EggsInJohtoToo",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you know?\r",
        "They find Eggs in the far-off Johto\n",
        "region, too."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le bruit court qu’ils trouvent des\n",
        "Oeufs aussi à Johto de temps en temps."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_EitherTheGymOrAContest",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re a Trainer, are you?\r",
        "You’ve got two choices of challenges,\n",
        "either the Gym or a Contest, right?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu es un Dresseur, n’est-ce pas?\r",
        "Tu as le choix entre deux compétitions,\n",
        "l’Arène ou les Concours, c’est ça?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_PeopleUnburdenThemselves",
      "en_US": [
        "At the Lost Tower, people unburden\n",
        "themselves of unbearable sorrow...\r",
        "You’ll understand what I mean if you\n",
        "visit the Lost Tower on Route 209."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Les gens viennent à la Tour Perdue pour\n",
        "se libérer de leur chagrin...\r",
        "Va y faire un tour, tu verras ce que je\n",
        "veux dire. Elle est sur la Route 209."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_ThisPlaceIsBeautiful",
      "en_US": [
        "This place is beautiful.\n",
        "Perhaps even too much so.\r",
        "Pokémon, people, and nature are in\n",
        "perfect harmony here."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cet endroit est d’une beauté\n",
        "remarquable... C’est presque trop.\r",
        "Ici, les Pokémon, les gens et la nature\n",
        "vivent en parfaite harmonie."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_ICantDecideWhatAccessories",
      "en_US": [
        "I can’t decide what Accessories I\n",
        "should dress up Pokémon with.\r",
        "There are just so many kinds."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je n’arrive pas à décider quels\n",
        "Accessoires mettre à mon Pokémon.\r",
        "Il y en a tellement!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_HowManyPokemonAreThere",
      "en_US": [
        "I get to see Pokémon all day long,\n",
        "but there sure are many kinds.\r",
        "How many are there now?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je vois des Pokémon toute la journée,\n",
        "mais c’est vrai qu’il y en a beaucoup.\r",
        "Combien de Pokémon a-t-on recensés\n",
        "jusqu’à maintenant?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_UsedFireStoneToEvolve",
      "en_US": [
        "I used a Fire Stone on my Pokémon,\n",
        "and it evolved!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "J’ai fait évoluer mon Pokémon en\n",
        "utilisant une Pierre Feu!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_ShowYouToContestHall",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m visiting here all the way from\n",
        "the Hoenn region.\r",
        "I had been hoping to find the Contest\n",
        "Hall, but being new, I lost my way.\r",
        "Fortunately, the local people very\n",
        "kindly led me to my destination.\r",
        "I was impressed by their kindness and\n",
        "generosity to a complete stranger.\r",
        "Now, may I offer you the courtesy\n",
        "of showing you to the Contest Hall?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je visite la ville, mais à l’origine,\n",
        "je viens de la région de Hoenn.\r",
        "Je voulais trouver la Salle de Concours,\n",
        "mais j’ai perdu ma route.\r",
        "Heureusement, les gens du coin ont eu\n",
        "la gentillesse de m’indiquer le chemin.\r",
        "C’est fou comme ils sont gentils\n",
        "et généreux avec les inconnus.\r",
        "Veux-tu que je te guide\n",
        "jusqu’à la Salle de Concours?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_PleaseFollowMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah.\n",
        "Please follow me.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bien.\n",
        "Suis-moi, s’il te plaît.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_ThisIsTheContestHall",
      "en_US": [
        "This is the Contest Hall.\n",
        "Please, do go inside."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Voici la Salle de Concours. Si tu veux\n",
        "bien te donner la peine d’entrer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_ItMakesMeHappy",
      "en_US": [
        "It makes me happy knowing I’ve\n",
        "helped another person."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ça me met de bonne humeur de savoir\n",
        "que j’ai pu rendre service à quelqu’un."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_IDoApologize",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, I do apologize.\n",
        "I should mind my own business."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh, vraiment, je m’excuse. Je ferais\n",
        "mieux de m’occuper de mes affaires."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_INoticeThingsLikeStairs",
      "en_US": [
        "When I take my baby out in his stroller,\n",
        "I see the town in a different way.\r",
        "I notice things like stairs and bumps\n",
        "in the sidewalk."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Quand je promène mon bébé dans sa\n",
        "poussette, je vois la ville différemment.\r",
        "Par exemple, j’ai tendance à remarquer\n",
        "les nids-de-poule et les escaliers..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_Apapapu",
      "en_US": "Apapapu!",
      "fr_FR": "Areuh areuh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_StrollWithPachirisu",
      "en_US": [
        "I went for a stroll in Amity Square\n",
        "with my PACHIRISU today.\r",
        "We came across a Pokémon feather\n",
        "while we walked.\r",
        "Do you think it’d make my PACHIRISU\n",
        "look any cuter?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je suis allé me balader au Square\n",
        "Paisible avec mon PACHIRISU\f",
        "aujourd’hui.\r",
        "On est tombés sur une plume de\n",
        "Pokémon en marchant.\r",
        "Tu penses que ça pourrait rendre mon\n",
        "PACHIRISU plus mignon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_PachirisuCryKyukyuuh",
      "en_US": "PACHIRISU: Kyukyuuh!",
      "fr_FR": "PACHIRISU: Pachi pachi!"
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_SometimesEggsAtDayCare",
      "en_US": [
        "I have a professor friend, and this is\n",
        "what he told me.\r",
        "If you leave a pair of Pokémon with the\n",
        "Day Care, sometimes Eggs are found.\r",
        "Or things that are like Eggs, anyway.\r",
        "I wonder how my pal Prof. Elm is doing\n",
        "these days?\r",
        "He was always a quiet sort and didn’t\n",
        "really stand out."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ecoute ce que m’a dit un professeur de\n",
        "mes amis.\r",
        "Si tu laisses deux Pokémon à la Pension,\n",
        "il arrive qu’on y trouve un Oeuf.\r",
        "Ou ce qui s’apparente à des Oeufs,\n",
        "du moins.\r",
        "Je me demande comment se porte mon ami\n",
        "le Professeur Orme...\r",
        "Il a toujours été du genre calme et\n",
        "discret."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_TheyCallMeMrGoods",
      "en_US": [
        "They call me Mr. Goods.\r",
        "No one knows my real name.\n",
        "No, not even I do...\r",
        "I dedicate myself to seeking rarities.\n",
        "It’s what I live for.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "On m’appelle Rico Lexion.\r",
        "Personne ne connaît mon véritable nom,\n",
        "pas même moi...\r",
        "J’ai voué mon existence à la collecte\n",
        "d’objets rares. C’est toute ma vie.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_Hmhmhmhm",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm!\n",
        "Hmhmhmhm?!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hum!\n",
        "Hum, hum, hum?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_Dummy26",
      "garbage": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_TalkToMeSomeOtherTime",
      "en_US": [
        "I was going to give you something,\n",
        "but I just gave a rare thing away.\r",
        "I’ll find something else for you,\n",
        "so just talk to me some other time."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "J’allais te faire un cadeau, mais je\n",
        "viens à peine d’offrir un objet rare.\r",
        "Je trouverai quelque chose d’autre,\n",
        "reviens me parler plus tard."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_Dummy28",
      "garbage": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_Dummy29",
      "garbage": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_YourUndergroundPCIsFull",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh? Your underground PC appears\n",
        "to be full.\r",
        "I’ll hold your gift until you make\n",
        "room for it. Tell me when, OK?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh? On dirait que ton PC souterrain\n",
        "est plein.\r",
        "Je garde ton cadeau jusqu’à ce que tu\n",
        "aies fait de la place. Préviens-moi, OK?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_Dummy31",
      "garbage": 45
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_TalkToMeSomeOtherTime2",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll find something rare for you,\n",
