      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCity_Text_YourAdventureHasGoneGlobal",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How impressive!\r",
        "Your adventure has gone global in\n",
        "scale, has it?\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
